sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Approved application
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant Gateway as Gateway + policy
    participant Runtime as CRM application Runtime
    participant Identity as AgentCore Identity
    participant Auth as Entra - dedicated CRM app
    participant CRM as Dynamics 365 / Dataverse
    Note over App,CRM: Phase one - summary-only update, live validation pending
    App->>Entra: Request app-only token for Gateway
    Entra-->>App: Gateway caller token
    App->>Gateway: Case ID and summary with caller token
    Note over Gateway: Authenticate application and authorize CRM update
    Gateway->>Runtime: Gateway AWS identity and signed caller context
    Note over Runtime: Check caller and allowed case, field and value
    Runtime->>Identity: Request token from approved CRM provider
    Identity->>Auth: Authenticate approved CRM application
    Auth-->>Identity: CRM API application token
    Identity-->>Runtime: CRM API token
    Runtime->>CRM: Update only the configured summary column
    Note over CRM: Enforce application record and field permissions
    CRM-->>Runtime: Acknowledgement or failure
    Runtime-->>Gateway: Minimal update result
    Gateway-->>App: Confirmation or failure
